{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A cozy horror game where you own and manage a burger shop.<br> <br><strong>Prepare burger.\u00a0</strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Serve customers. </strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Survive midnight nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late Shift - Midnight Burger is a psychological horror games inspired by The Boba Teashop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese and Indonesian.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~30 minutes (The demo version has fewer stories compared to the full version)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Burger Tower\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Create custom burgers of different types. You can even make burgers as high as the roof.<br><br>\u3010Mini Games\u3011 <br>\u00a0 You can play darts while waiting for customers to arrive. <br><br>\u3010Jumpscare\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Beware of jumpscares that can appear suddenly.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733910?t=1747350261","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733910?t=1747350261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733910/81c9d2d52e777824159c1f0892f75d828cf11b71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747350261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733910/81c9d2d52e777824159c1f0892f75d828cf11b71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747350261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A cozy horror game where you own and manage a burger shop.<br> <br><strong>Prepare burger.\u00a0</strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Serve customers. </strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Survive midnight nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Late Shift - Midnight Burger is a psychological horror games inspired by The Boba Teashop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese and Indonesian.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~30 minutes (The demo version has fewer stories compared to the full version)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Burger Tower\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Create custom burgers of different types. You can even make burgers as high as the roof.<br><br>\u3010Mini Games\u3011 <br>\u00a0 You can play darts while waiting for customers to arrive. <br><br>\u3010Jumpscare\u3011 <br>\u00a0 Beware of jumpscares that can appear suddenly.</p>","developers":["Manja Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3719160","name":"Late Shift - Midnight Burger"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733910/8f8b9c0fb4d72a9d4b7fb0c7d821f3e9b0f22c46/header.jpg?t=1747350261","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 32/64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64/X86 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 550<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 32/64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64/X86 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140073,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.ste